# The build artefacts in this directory are FIXTURES, not artefacts: the
# forge-demo-source-filter check exists to prove mkLispSource keeps them out
# of the store, and it can only prove that if they are actually there.
#
# They have to be re-included explicitly because ignoring *.fasl in a global
# ~/.config/git/ignore is a near-universal habit, and inside a flake the source
# tree is the *tracked* tree -- an ignored fixture would silently disappear and
# turn `test ! -e "$plain/stale-build-artifact.fasl"` into an assertion that
# passes because the file never existed. A nested .gitignore takes precedence
# over the global one, so this negation is what keeps the check honest.
!*.fasl
!*.core
